{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44924","headline":"寄羽林卢大夫将军 · 无可","name":"寄羽林卢大夫将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军直禁闱，绣服耀金羁。\n羽卫九天静，英豪四塞知。\n望云回朔鴈，隔水射宫麋。\n旧国无归思，秋堂梦战时。\n门风荀氏敌，劒艺霍家推。\n计日旌旄下，萧萧万马随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}